{"/api/discogs/artist/1198014/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"1198014","image":"https://i.discogs.com/091Ta04MYSqJ5r1DHt0gfgcNFZ7h6RT1iRakPX9dCQc/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:450/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTExOTgw/MTQtMTI3Njg5Njkx/Ni5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/taEofXgbN9qJfJqy924hsRSjQRyfZhP6a6FFud5Ga8A/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTExOTgw/MTQtMTI3Njg5Njkx/Ni5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"UK music has very well been blessed with the contributions of Hardhouse Banton, who some have heard maybe their favourite producers favourite producer!  Alongside a group of like minded individuals of course, HHBanton was heavily responsible for the rise of the exiting UKFunky House Scene which had its roots and was birthed in the London Underground House Scene. HHBanton has easily navigated through the ever-changing \"Sound\" of London's dance music circuit, whilst maintaining his unique individual characteristics that make his work noticeable and much respected by fans and musical peers alike. HHBanton’s range of eclectic releases over the years shows the ability to fully express his much deeper affections and emotions for House Music, whereas at times he may have only skimmed the surface. Future releases will show and undoubtably serve to stretch the peoples perceptions of himself as a producer/DJ, writing not only house music, but records that will cross and border a variety of genres. \r\n","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:1198014","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":230455,"name":"Banton"},{"id":2762996,"name":"Jamal Banton"},{"id":8211568,"name":"HHb"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["Hard House Bantons","HardHouse Banton","Hardhouse","Hardhouse Banton"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/1198014-Hard-House-Banton","type":"artist","urls":["https://soundcloud.com/officialbanton","http://www.myspace.com/HardhouseBanton","https://www.facebook.com/Officia